      "comment": "THREE HEARTS (3) comes off an average performance last start when sixth at this track over 380m behind Ringwald (22.77) in a Grade 4/5. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in three starts. Rates on top in this line up. POPULAR MONSTER (7) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (29.87) in a Grade 5 at this track. Key player if finds best. SHE'S SNAPPY (1) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 6 lengths eighth (29.44) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 498m. Better than last start and can bounce back. BULLEMOR BANNER (2) is worth a look over a shorter trip this time.",
